 such: vậy nên, theo đó\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"attempt to do: cố gắng làm gì\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"win A back: giành lại A\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"ask A to do: yêu cầu A làm gì\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"reach out to: tiếp cận, liên lạc với ai\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"generous [Tính từ] phóng\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"employment offer: đề nghị tuyển dụng\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"would like: muốn\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"recommendation [Danh từ] sự giới thiệu\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"effective [Tính từ] có hiệu quả\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"way [Danh từ] phương pháp, cách làm\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"increase [Động từ] tăng\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}],[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"earnings [Danh từ] khoản tiền thu được\",\"weight\":\"#w400\"}]]}]]}"
                }
